of,trim,glass,accent\ncourier-jet | aircraft | plane,jet,aeroplane,airplane,aircraft,airliner | palette=heritage-racing|coastal-delivery|desert-utility colours:body,roof,trim,glass,accent\nstarfighter | spaceship | starfighter,spaceship,starship,spacecraft,fighter,space fighter,rocket ship,x-wing | length:12-28e wingspan:8-28e wing_style=delta|swept|straight nose engines=1|2|4 colours:hull_colour,wing_colour,accent_colour,canopy_colour,engine_colour,engine_core\narcade-bay | building,scene | arcade,arch,archway,colonnade,bay,gateway | height:2-10 colours:colour,accent\nstreet-lantern | garden,scene | lamp,lantern,street lamp,lamppost,streetlight | height:2-10 colours:colour,accent",
